  "sourceTitle": "Whip Cream Frosting",
  "sourceText": "Whip Cream Frosting\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:55pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup Crisco\n1/2 cup milk\n2 tablespoons flour\n1/2 cup butter\n3/4 cup granulated sugar\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add all ingredients in medium bowl and whip for 7 minutes. Be sure you whip it the full 7 minutes. Makes enough for a layer cake or 24 cupcakes.",
